window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Two demons walk into a courtroom. Only one is expected to walk out.</b></p> <p>Adeline Boo Pond thought she was done being hunted. But when a demon council summons drags her into a courtroom alongside Julian, Adie is forced to face her past under oath. The crimes? Complicated. The punishment? Potentially lethal.</p> <p>As accusations fly, Adie finds herself at odds with the very people she’s come to care about. The council wants blood. The prosecution wants leverage. And demon law demands that someone pay the price.</p> <p>With her freedom on the line and Julian’s fate tangled with her own, Adie must navigate lies, legal traps, and betrayals that hit far too close to home. Tobias, Emil, and Kellen will fight for her. But this time, it might not be enough.</p> <p>Trust is fragile. Love is volatile. And in the demon courts, the truth is just another weapon.</p> <p><b>Do you love books with...</b></p> <p>•Courtroom chaos and demonic politics?</p> <p>•Broken trust, slow-burn healing, and scorching loyalty?</p> <p>•A heroine who refuses to be sacrificed, even for the greater good?</p> <p>•Heartache, humor, and heat in every chapter?</p> <p><i>Succubus Trials</i> is the sixth book in the (un)Lucky Succubus series, a spicy reverse harem urban fantasy about love under fire, power under judgment, and demons who refuse to let go.</p>"; 
